<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SIAD 2.0 — Sistem Informasi Arsip Digital | Portal Kepenghuluan Rokan Hilir</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Portal Resmi SIAD 2.0 - Sistem Informasi Arsip Digital & Tata Kelola Keuangan 183 Kepenghuluan se-Kabupaten Rokan Hilir, Riau.">
    <link rel="icon" href="/img/logo.png" type="image/png">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free@6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script>
      window.SIAD_DATA = {
        namaDesa: "<%= locals.profil_desa ? locals.profil_desa.nama_kepenghuluan : 'Kepenghuluan Rokan Hilir' %>",
        namaKepalaDesa: "Inspektorat Kabupaten Rokan Hilir",
        alamat: "<%= locals.profil_desa ? locals.profil_desa.alamat : 'Jl. Brigjen Katamso, Bagansiapiapi' %>",
        deskripsiProfil: "Portal resmi Sistem Informasi Arsip Digital (SIAD) 2.0 untuk tata kelola 183 kepenghuluan di Kabupaten Rokan Hilir, Provinsi Riau."
      };
    </script>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        :root {
            --primary: #1d4ed8;
            --primary-dark: #0f2b82;
            --accent-green: #10b981;
            --dark: #0a1128;
            --dark-card: #131f47;
            --slate-text: #94a3b8;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: #070d1e;
            color: #f8fafc;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        h1, h2, h3, h4, .font-sora { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; }

        /* NAVBAR */
        .navbar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 18px 5%;
            background: rgba(10, 17, 40, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .brand img {
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .brand-text {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .brand-sub {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--slate-text);
            font-weight: 600;
            display: block;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .nav-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .btn-wa {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
            color: #34d399;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-wa:hover {
            background: #10b981;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .btn-login {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1d4ed8);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 9px 22px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-login:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6);
        }

        /* HERO SECTION */
        .hero {
            padding: 80px 5% 60px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25) 0%, rgba(7, 13, 30, 0) 70%);
        }
        .badge-rohil {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3);
            color: #93c5fd;
            padding: 6px 18px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 40%, #93c5fd 80%, #34d399 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 17px;
            color: var(--slate-text);
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 0 auto 35px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .hero-cta {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .btn-cta-main {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1e40af);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.45);
            transition: all 0.25s;
        }
        .btn-cta-main:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6);
        }
        .btn-cta-wa {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.25s;
        }
        .btn-cta-wa:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        /* STATS STRIP */
        .stats-strip {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            max-width: 1050px;
            margin: 0 auto 70px;
            padding: 25px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 18px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .stat-item {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .stat-item .num {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
        }
        .stat-item .lbl {
            font-size: 12.5px;
            color: var(--slate-text);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        /* FEATURES SECTION */
        .features-section {
            padding: 40px 5% 80px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .section-header p {
            color: var(--slate-text);
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }
        .feature-box {
            background: var(--dark-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 28px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .feature-box:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .feature-icon {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .feature-icon.blue { background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2); color: #60a5fa; }
        .feature-icon.green { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: #34d399; }
        .feature-icon.amber { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: #fbbf24; }
        .feature-icon.purple { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); color: #c084fc; }
        .feature-box h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .feature-box p {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: var(--slate-text);
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        /* VALIDASI PUBLIK SECTION */
        .check-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.3), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6));
            border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto 70px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .check-section h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .check-section p {
            color: var(--slate-text);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .check-form {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            justify-content: center;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .check-form input {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
        }
        .check-form button {
            padding: 12px 20px;
            background: var(--accent-green);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .check-form button:hover { background: #059669; }

        /* FOOTER */
        .footer {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 40px 5% 30px;
            background: #040813;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--slate-text);
        }
        .footer-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
        }
        .footer-brand {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .footer-contact {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .footer-contact a {
            color: #38bdf8;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .footer-contact a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .footer-bottom {
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* FLOATING WA BUTTON */
        .floating-wa {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 25px;
            right: 25px;
            background: #25d366;
            color: #fff;
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.4);
            text-decoration: none;
            z-index: 9999;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .floating-wa:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.6);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 30px; }
            .hero p { font-size: 14.5px; }
            .navbar { padding: 14px 16px; }
            .nav-actions .btn-wa span { display: none; }
            .stats-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; }
            .check-form { flex-direction: column; }
            .footer-content { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR RESMI -->
    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="/" class="brand">
            <img src="/img/logo.png" alt="Logo SIAD" onerror="this.src='/images/logo_rohil.png';">
            <div>
                <span class="brand-text">SIAD 2.0</span>
                <span class="brand-sub">Kabupaten Rokan Hilir</span>
            </div>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-actions">
            <a href="https://wa.me/6285265740588?text=Halo%20Admin%20SIAD%202.0%20Rohil,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20mengenai%20aplikasi%20SIAD." target="_blank" class="btn-wa">
                <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i> <span>0852-6574-0588</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/portal" class="btn-login">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i> <span>Portal</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <header class="hero">
        <div class="badge-rohil">
            🏛️ Platform Tata Kelola 183 Kepenghuluan Kabupaten Rokan Hilir
        </div>
        <h1>Sistem Informasi Arsip Digital & Keuangan Desa Terpadu</h1>
        <p>
            Platform digital terintegrasi cloud Google Drive untuk penatausahaan naskah dinas, verifikasi berjenjang SPJ 4-tier ber-QR Code, dan kepatuhan buku pembantu pajak dana desa sesuai standar <b>Permendagri No. 20 Tahun 2018</b>.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-cta">
            <a href="/portal" class="btn-cta-main">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i> Masuk ke Portal Layanan
            </a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/6285265740588?text=Halo%20Admin%20SIAD%202.0%20Rohil,%20saya%20ingin%20jadwalkan%20presentasi%20dan%20Bimtek." target="_blank" class="btn-cta-wa">
                <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" style="color: #34d399;"></i> Layanan Konsultasi & Bimtek
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- STATISTIK RINGKAS SISTEM -->
        <div class="stats-strip">
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="num">18</div>
                <div class="lbl">Kecamatan se-Rohil</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="num">183</div>
                <div class="lbl">Kepenghuluan Terdata</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="num">4-Tier</div>
                <div class="lbl">Verifikasi SPJ Sah</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="num">100%</div>
                <div class="lbl">Cloud Google Vault</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 4 PILAR LAYANAN UTAMA -->
    <section class="features-section">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>4 Pilar Utama Sistem SIAD 2.0</h2>
            <p>Dirancang khusus untuk mempermudah tugas Penghulu, Sekdes, dan Bendahara serta bebas temuan audit.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-box">
                <div class="feature-icon blue">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope-open-text"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Disposisi Surat Masuk Digital</h3>
                <p>Pencatatan naskah dinas kedinasan, arahan langsung dari Penghulu, dan pencetakan Lembar Disposisi resmi A4 ber-Kop Pemkab Rokan Hilir.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-box">
                <div class="feature-icon green">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Verifikasi SPJ 4-Tier & QR Code</h3>
                <p>Alur estafet pengesahan transparan (Kaur ➔ Bendahara ➔ Sekdes ➔ Penghulu). SPJ disahkan dengan QR Code anti-pemalsuan yang dapat dicek lewat kamera HP.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-box">
                <div class="feature-icon amber">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-receipt"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Buku Pembantu Pajak & Excel</h3>
                <p>Perekaman pemotongan PPN, PPh 21, 22, 23, dan Pajak Daerah dengan nomor NTPN/Billing. Ekspor spreadsheet Excel sekali klik dan cetak Buku Pajak Permendagri 20/2018.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-box">
                <div class="feature-icon purple">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Brankas Cloud Google Drive</h3>
                <p>Semua berkas SPJ, bukti bayar bank, dan scan naskah dinas tersimpan aman di Google Drive resmi desa. Tidak ada risiko dokumen hilang saat pergantian pimpinan.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WIDGET CEK VALIDASI PUBLIK DOKUMEN -->
    <section class="check-section">
        <div style="font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px;">🔍</div>
        <h3>Cek Keaslian Berkas SPJ Kepenghuluan</h3>
        <p>Masyarakat atau tim pemeriksa (Inspektorat / BPK) dapat memverifikasi keabsahan lembar pengesahan SPJ dengan memasukkan ID Dokumen:</p>
        <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); var id = document.getElementById('cekSpjId').value.trim(); if(id) window.location.href='/validasi/spj/' + id;" class="check-form">
            <input type="number" id="cekSpjId" placeholder="Masukkan ID SPJ (Cth: 101)" required>
            <button type="submit">Cek Validasi</button>
        </form>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div>
                <div class="footer-brand">SIAD 2.0 ENTERPRISE</div>
                <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Sistem Informasi Arsip Digital & Tata Kelola Keuangan Desa</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 3px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">Pemerintah Kabupaten Rokan Hilir, Provinsi Riau</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-contact">
                <div>
                    <div style="font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 4px;">Layanan Dukungan Teknis & Kemitraan:</div>
                    <div><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" style="color: #34d399;"></i> WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/6285265740588" target="_blank">0852-6574-0588</a></div>
                    <div><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i> Bagansiapiapi - Rokan Hilir, Riau</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            &copy; 2026 SIAD 2.0 &bull; Hak Cipta Dilindungi &bull; Tata Kelola Administrasi Pemerintahan Kepenghuluan Rokan Hilir
        </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- FLOATING WHATSAPP BUTTON -->
    <a href="https://wa.me/6285265740588?text=Halo%20Admin%20SIAD%202.0%20Rohil,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20mengenai%20aplikasi%20SIAD." target="_blank" class="floating-wa" title="Hubungi Helpdesk WhatsApp">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i>
    </a>

</body>
</html>